        impact: "I was terrified. I came out of the elevator in that garage and saw the bear sitting on my car hood, and I knew what it meant. I had a protective order for a reason. I sat in my car with the doors locked for twenty minutes before I could call anyone.",
        doctrines: ["burdenOfProof"],
        genders: ["D": .male, "V": .female])

    static let lakeCabinRansomV1 = SmallCases.make(
