        role: "Venue security guard",
        exam: [.direct("What does the camera show about {D}?", "\"It shows {D} swinging a folding chair. The video is clear, and it shows more than one swing.\""), .direct("How many people were hurt?", "\"Seven. The medical reports list each injury.\""), .direct("What happened in the lot after the concert?", "\"Around eleven, a shouting match in the lot turned into a melee with dozens of people pushing and swinging. Seven people ended up hurt, some with head injuries.\""), .direct("What did you see the defendant do?", "\"{D.He} was in the middle of the crowd and swung a folding chair at least twice. The lot camera shows it clearly.\""), .direct("How did the melee end?", "\"Security and deputies pushed into the crowd around 11:15 and separated groups. Arrests began around midnight.\""), .direct("How did you break up the fighting in the lot?", "\"We moved in as a group with lights and radios and pulled people apart one at a time. It took about ten minutes before the lot was clear.\""), .cross("{D} says {D.he} was shielding a friend, doesn't {D.he}?", "\"A vendor says a friend was lying hurt near {DL}'s feet. I will say I saw that too.\""), .cross("Did the defendant start the fight?", "\"I do not know. I saw {D.him} in the middle after it started.\""), .cross("Who else was swinging?", "\"Several people. It was chaos.\""), .cross("A friend lay hurt near the defendant's feet, didn't one?", "\"I saw someone on the ground near {DL}. I cannot say who it was or how it happened.\""), .cross("You cannot say who started it, can you?", "\"No. By the time I reached the middle, it was already a free-for-all.\"")],
        defenseRole: "Vendor",
        defenseExam: [.direct("Was a friend of {D}'s hurt in the lot?", "\"Yes. A friend of {D}'s was on the ground, bleeding and not moving much, and people were swinging nearby.\""), .direct("Did the defendant hurt that friend?", "\"No. I saw {DF} step in front of the friend. {DF} did not hit the friend or anyone near the friend.\""), .direct("Where were you standing during the fight?", "\"At my vendor stand at the edge of the lot. I saw the whole thing from about twenty feet.\""), .direct("What is your role?", "\"I sell concessions from a stand at the edge of the lot. I was open late that night.\""), .direct("What did you see?", "\"Two groups arguing and then a wave of people rushing in. I saw {DF} carrying a chair.\""), .direct("What did the defendant do?", "\"Swung it twice near a person on the ground, then dropped it. {D.He} looked scared.\""), .cross("Did you see the defendant swing the folding chair?", "\"I did. I saw {DF} swing it at least once, toward people who were coming at the friend.\""), .cross("Did you see who started the fight?", "\"No. It was already going when I looked up. People were yelling and shoving.\""), .cross("How many times did the defendant swing?", "\"Maybe twice. I did not count. It was all happening fast.\""), .cross("You did not see how it began, did you?", "\"No. I looked up after the noise started.\""), .cross("You cannot say whether the defendant hit anyone, can you?", "\"I saw swings but did not see contact.\"")],
        theory: ("{D} joined a melee.", "Shielding a friend."),
